 "突っこみ": "تُهْمَة (accusation) / اِتَّهَمَ (To formally accuse (a person) of a crime.) / شَحَنَ (To place a burden, load or responsibility on or in.) / شَحَنَ (To load equipment with material required for its use, as a firearm with powder, ) / هَاجَمَ (To move forward quickly and forcefully, particularly in combat and/or on horseba)  [charge] / عَمْق (the vertical distance below a surface; the degree to which something is deep)  [depth] / [straight man (of a comedy duo)] / طعني (A smart, sarcastic turn or jest; a taunt; a severe retort or comeback; a gibe.)  [quip]",
 "突っこむ": "[to thrust (something) into (something) ; to cram]\nمثال: １人少年が両手をポケットにつっこんで歩いていた。\n→ A boy was walking with his hands in his pockets. / [to plunge into ; to charge into]\nمثال: 私たちはそのまま洞窟の口にボートで突っ込んで行きました。\n→ We plunged into the cave opening on our boat and continued on. / [to delve into (a matter) ; to go into depth]\nمثال: 彼は古代史の分野で突っ込んだ研究をしている。\n→ He's doing in-depth research on ancient history. / أَشَارَ (To identify among a group of similar subjects, or in a scene where the subject m)  [to point out (e.g. an inconsistency)]",
 "突っつく": "خَزَّ (To prod or jab with an object such as a finger or a stick.)  [to poke (repeatedly, lightly)]\nمثال: ハゲタカが突っつく死んだ鹿とか、他の動物の食べ残しとか、 そういう腐った肉を死肉と書きました。\n→ A dead deer being pecked by vultures, remains partly eaten by other animals, that sort of rotten meat is called 'carrion'. / [to peck at (one's food) ; to pick at] / [to peck at (someone's faults, etc.)] / [to egg on ; to put up to]",
 "突っぱねる": "رَفَضَ (To refuse to accept; to forswear.)  [to reject]\nمثال: トムはメアリーを口説きおとすことができなかった。メアリーはトムのデートの要求を突っぱねたから。\n→ Tom couldn't make the grade with Mary; she refused him when he asked her for a date.",
 "突っ切る": "صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross]\nمثال: 彼はシャーウッドの森を突っ切って通り抜けて行った。\n→ He cut through Sherwood Forest.",
 "突っ張り": "سِنَاد, عِمَاد (An object placed against or under another, to support it; anything that supports) / دَعَمَ, عَمَدَ (To support or shore up something.)  [prop] / تَشَنُّج, شَدٌّ عَضَلِيّ (A painful contraction of a muscle which cannot be controlled; (sometimes) a simi)  [cramp] / [thrust ; slapping attacks] / بَانْك, بَانْك (A follower of any of these movements, including:)  [punk]\nusu. written as ツッパリ",
