 "立ち": "رَحِيل, مُغَادَرَة (The act of departing or something that has departed.)  [departure] / [being used up ; being consumed] / [passage of time ; lapse] / بَرُوفَة (The practising of something which is to be performed before an audience, usually)  [rehearsal]",
 "立ちくらみ": "دُوَار (The state of being dizzy; the sensation of instability.)  [dizziness (from standing up too fast)]\nمثال: 立ちくらみがします。\n→ I get dizzy spells when I stand up.",
 "立ちこめる": "كفن (Especially, the dress for the dead; a winding sheet.)  [to shroud]\nمثال: 湖から霧が立ちこめてきた。\n→ The fog was rising from the lake.",
