 "立ち振舞う": "عَمَل (Something done, a deed.) / قَانُون ((In the United States) A legislative proposal, a bill that has not yet become la) / مَثَّلَ (To perform a theatrical role.) / تَصَرَّفَ (To behave in a certain manner for an indefinite length of time.)  [to act]",
