 "立ち越える": "[to rise above ; to transcend] / فَاقَ, تَجَاوَزَ (To go beyond or exceed (something) in an adjudicative or literal sense.)  [to surpass] / خَرَجَ (To leave, especially a building.) / خَرَجَ (To leave one's abode to go to public places, especially for recreation or entert)  [to go out]",
