 "立つ": "وَقَفَ, وقف (To position or be positioned physically:)  [to stand (up)]\nمثال: 次々に立って出ていった。\n→ One after another they stood up and went out. / وَقَفَ, وقف (To position or be positioned physically:)  [to stand (in a position; of a person, tree, building, etc.)]\nمثال: しかし、あなたがたのなかに、あなたがたが知らない方が立っておられます。\n→ But among you stands one you do not know. / كَانَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ هُوَ, هِيَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ (As an intransitive lexical verb:)  [to be (in difficulties, the lead, etc.)]\nمثال: その大臣は不正取引によって窮地に立ちました。\n→ The minister was in a fix over illegal dealings. / تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [to leave (to do something)]\nمثال: 失礼しますといって席を立った。\n→ I excused myself from the table.",
