 "結合価": "تكافؤ (The combining capacity of an atom, functional group, or radical determined by th) / تَعَلُّق (The number of arguments that a verb can have, including its subject, ranging fro) / تكافؤ (A one-dimensional value assigned by a person to an object, situation, or state, )  [valence]",
