 "結婚": "زَوَاج, نِكَاح (The state of being married.) / زَوَاج (A union of two or more people that creates a family tie and carries legal, socia) / عُرْس, زِفَاف (A wedding; a ceremony in which people wed.)  [marriage]\nمثال: 結婚の申し込みが殺到した。\n→ Marriage proposals flooded in.",
 "結婚式": "عُرْس, زِفَاف (A marriage ceremony; a ritual officially celebrating the beginning of a marriage)  [wedding]\nمثال: 彼らの結婚式に招待された。\n→ I was invited to their wedding.",
 "結婚指輪": "خَاتَم زَوَاج (Either of a pair or rings exchanged by spouses in a wedding ceremony, and afterw)  [wedding ring]\nمثال: 妊婦妻がいるのに結婚指輪外して合コンに参加してもいいですか？\n→ Is it OK for me to remove my wedding ring and go to a dating party when I have a pregnant wife?",
 "結婚相手": "زَوْج, زَوْجَة (A person in a marriage or marital relationship.)  [spouse]\nمثال: 彼女の条件が結婚相手を選ぶ際の優先事項だ。\n→ Her conditions for choosing a marriage partner took priority. / خَطِيبَة (A woman who is engaged to be married; the woman to whom one is engaged.)  [fiancée]",
