 "結局": "فِي النِّهَايَة (Anyway, in any case; indicates a statement is true regardless of other considera)  [after all]\nمثال: ゆっくりと着実なのが結局勝つ。\n→ Slow and steady wins the race. / نَتِيجَة (In an argument or syllogism, the proposition that follows as a necessary consequ)  [conclusion] / [end of a game of go, shogi, etc.]",
