 "結成": "تَشَكُّل (The process during which something comes into being and gains its characteristic) / تَشْكِيلَة (A grouping of military units or smaller formations under a command, such as a br) / تَشْكِيلَة (An arrangement of moving troops, ships, or aircraft, such as a wedge, line abrea)  [formation]\nمثال: ボート競技に参加する為に新チームが結成された。\n→ A new team was formed in order to take part in the boat race.",
 "結晶": "قَرِيس, قَرِيت (A solid composed of an array of atoms or molecules possessing long-range order a) / قَرِيس, قَرِيت (A piece of glimmering, shining mineral resembling ice or glass.)  [crystal]\nمثال: 彼は海水から塩を結晶させて取り出した。\n→ He crystallized salt from seawater. / فَاكِهَة (A product of fertilization in a plant, specifically:) / ثَمَرَة, شَاذّ جِنْسِيًّا (An effeminate man.) / أَثْمَرَ (To produce fruit, seeds, or spores.)  [fruits (of labor, union, etc.)]\nمثال: あのかわいい赤ちゃんは彼らの愛の結晶です。\n→ That cute baby is the fruit of their love.",
 "結末": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end]\nمثال: 物語は結末に近づいた。\n→ The story drew to a conclusion.",
 "結束": "اِتِّحَاد, اِتِّفَاق (The state of being united or joined; a state of unity or harmony.) / زَوَاج (The act or state of marriage.)  [union] / إِبَالَة, حُزْمَة (A group of objects held together by wrapping or tying.)  [bundling] / [putting on (clothes, armour, etc.)]",
 "結果": "تَسَبَّب (To proceed, spring up or rise, as a consequence, from facts, arguments, premises) / نَتِيجَة (That which results; the conclusion or end to which any course or condition of th)  [result]\nمثال: 私達は息を殺して実験の結果を待った。\n→ We held our breath and waited for the result of the experiment. / بِٱلتَّالِي, وَعَلَيْهِ فَإِنَّ (As a result or consequence of something; subsequently.)  [consequently]\nمثال: 結果、計算ミスが多い。\n→ There are a lot of results and a calculation mistakes. / تَالٍ, التَّالِي (Coming next, either in sequence or in time.) / بَعْد (After, subsequent to.)  [following]\nafter the attributive form of a verb or adjective, or the particle の\nمثال: 大雪の結果、彼女は遅れた。\n→ She was late as a result of the heavy snow. / فَاكِهَة (A product of fertilization in a plant, specifically:) / ثَمَرَة, شَاذّ جِنْسِيًّا (An effeminate man.) / أَثْمَرَ (To produce fruit, seeds, or spores.)  [fruiting]",
