 "置く": "وَضَعَ, حَطَّ (To physically place (sth or sb swh).)  [to put]\nمثال: それをテーブルの上に置きなさい。\n→ Lay it on the table. / تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [to leave (behind)]\nمثال: あいにく私はカメラを家においてきた。\n→ As it happens, I have left the camera at home. / [to establish (an organization, a facility, a position, etc.) ; to set up] / أَجَّرَ (To obtain the services of in return for fixed payment.) / اِسْتَخْدَمَ, شَغَّلَ (To employ; to obtain the services of (a person) in exchange for remuneration; to)  [to hire]",
