 "聞ゆ": "[to be heard ; to be audible] / قَالَ, قال (To pronounce.) / يَتْلُو (To recite.) / قَالَ, قَالَ (To tell, either verbally or in writing.)  [to say] / فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do]\nafter the -masu stem of a verb",
