 "聞付ける": "سَمِع (To perceive sounds through the ear.)  [to hear]\nمثال: 私の声を聞きつけて、私の犬は耳をそばだてた。\n→ At the sound of my voice, my dog pricked up his ears. / [to hear about (rumour, etc.) ; to overhear] / [to get used to hearing]",
 "聞入れる": "مَنَحَ (To give (bestow upon or confer, particularly in answer to prayer or request).) / مِنْحة (An application for a grant (monetary boon to aid research or the like).)  [to grant (a wish)]\nمثال: 市長は私達の願いを聞き入れてくれた。\n→ The mayor granted our request.",
