 "聞届ける": "مَنَحَ (To give (bestow upon or confer, particularly in answer to prayer or request).) / مِنْحة (An application for a grant (monetary boon to aid research or the like).)  [to grant (a request)]",
 "聞損なう": "[to mishear ; to fail to catch] / أَخْطَأَ (To fail to hit, catch, grasp, etc.) / فَاتَ (To fail to experience, attend, partake, take advantage of, etc.) / اِفْتَقَدَ, اِشْتَاقَ (To become aware of the loss or absence of; to feel the want or need of, sometime) / آنِسَة (An unmarried woman; a girl.)  [to miss (the chance to hear)]",
