 "聟": "زَوْج, بَعْل (The male of a pair of animals.) / زَوْج (To conserve.)  [husband] / زَوْج اَلاِبْنَة, صِهْر (The husband of one's child.)  [(one's) son-in-law]",
 "聡い": "ذَكِيّ (Smart, intelligent, or witty; mentally quick or sharp.)  [clever]\nمثال: さりげなく聡いこの子にはうかつな事はとても言えない。\n→ You just can't let things slip around this nonchalantly smart girl. / حَادّ (Terminating in a point or edge, especially one that can cut or pierce easily; no)  [sharp (ear, etc.)]",
