 "聢と": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly]\nمثال: しかとは知りません。\n→ I don't know for certain. / بِالضَّبْط, تَمَامًا (Without approximation; precisely.) / بِالْضَبْط (Signifies agreement or recognition.)  [exactly] / [firmly ; tightly]",
 "聯隊": "فَوْج (A unit of armed troops under the command of an officer, and consisting of severa)  [regiment]\nمثال: この犬は我が連隊のマスコットだ。\n→ This dog is our regimental mascot.",
