 "聳り立つ": "نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (steeply)]\nمثال: 川べりには工場の煙突が林のようにそそり立っている。\n→ The riverside bristles with factory chimneys.",
